{"id": "3295632", "name": "קיצון מוחלט בתחום עם קשת וקטע ישר", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "functions": [{"name": "xmap", "params": ["S", "T"], "body": "if orient=1 then cx+S\n elseif orient=2 then cx+S\n elseif orient=3 then cx+T\n else cx-T"}, {"name": "ymap", "params": ["S", "T"], "body": "if orient=1 then cy+T\n elseif orient=2 then cy-T\n elseif orient=3 then cy+S\n else cy+S"}, {"name": "leadterm", "params": ["c", "m"], "body": "if c=1 then m\n elseif c=-1 then sconcat(\"-\",m)\n else sconcat(string(c),m)"}, {"name": "addterm", "params": ["c", "m"], "body": "if c=0 then \"\"\n elseif c=1 then sconcat(\"+\",m)\n elseif c=-1 then sconcat(\"-\",m)\n elseif c>0 then sconcat(\"+\",string(c),m)\n else sconcat(string(c),m)"}, {"name": "addconst", "params": ["c"], "body": "if c=0 then \"\"\n elseif c>0 then sconcat(\"+\",string(c))\n else string(c)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">קיצון מוחלט בתחום עם קשת וקטע ישר</div><p>נתונה הפונקציה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle f(x,y)={{CT:0}}\\)</p><p>בתחום הסגור המוגדר על ידי</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:1}}\\leq {{CT:2}}\\)<br>[[if test=\"{{CT:5}}\"]] \\(\\displaystyle y\\ge {{CT:3}}\\) [[/if]] [[if test=\"{{CT:6}}\"]] \\(\\displaystyle y\\le {{CT:3}}\\) [[/if]] [[if test=\"{{CT:7}}\"]] \\(\\displaystyle x\\ge {{CT:4}}\\) [[/if]] [[if test=\"{{CT:8}}\"]] \\(\\displaystyle x\\le {{CT:4}}\\) [[/if]]</p><p>שפת התחום מורכבת מקטע ישר ומקשת מעגלית. מצאו את נקודות הקיצון המוחלט ואת ערכי הפונקציה בהן.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span>מספר הנקודות החשודות</div><p>כמה נקודות חשודות <b>שונות</b> יש לבדוק על שפת התחום? את שתי נקודות החיבור בין הקטע לקשת סופרים פעם אחת בלבד.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:candidatecount]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:candidatecount]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span>הנקודה הפנימית של הקשת</div><p>על הקשת המעגלית, מעבר לשתי נקודות הקצה, מתקבלת נקודה חשודה אחת. מצאו אותה.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle x=\\) [[input:ans1]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle y=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ג׳</span>נקודת המינימום המוחלט</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(x_{\\min}=\\) [[input:ans3]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(y_{\\min}=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]] [[validation:ans4]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ד׳</span>נקודת המקסימום המוחלט</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(x_{\\max}=\\) [[input:ans5]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(y_{\\max}=\\) [[input:ans6]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans5]] [[validation:ans6]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ה׳</span>ערכי הקיצון</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\min f=\\) [[input:ans7]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\max f=\\) [[input:ans8]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans7]] [[validation:ans8]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> אין נקודה קריטית בפנים התחום, ולכן בודקים את שני חלקי השפה: על הקטע הישר ועל הקשת הפונקציה היא פונקציה של משתנה אחד. משווים את ערכי כל הנקודות החשודות.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — פנים התחום</b><br><p>בפנים התחום מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t&gt;0\\)</span>. מן הנגזרות מתקבל שאין נקודה קריטית פנימית, ולכן יש לבדוק את שני חלקי השפה.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הקטע הישר</b><br><p>על הקטע הישר מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t=0\\)</span>, ולכן</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle f={{CT:9}}\\)<br>\\(\\displaystyle f'={{CT:10}}\\)</p>[[if test=\"{{CT:20}}\"]]<p>מתקבלות שתי נקודות קריטיות פנימיות של הקטע, עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(s=\\pm{{CT:11}}\\)</span>, בנוסף לשתי נקודות הקצה.</p>[[else]]<p>אין נקודות קריטיות פנימיות של הקטע, ולכן בקטע יש לבדוק רק את שתי נקודות הקצה.</p>[[/if]]</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — הקשת המעגלית (סעיף ב׳)</b><br><p>על הקשת מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(s^2+t^2=R^2\\)</span>, ולכן הפונקציה מצטמצמת ל</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle f={{CT:12}}\\)<br>\\(\\displaystyle f'={{CT:13}}\\)</p><p>מעבר לשתי נקודות הקצה, מתקבלת הנקודה החשודה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle P_{\\mathrm{arc}}={{CT:14}}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 4 — השוואה (סעיפים א׳, ג׳–ה׳)</b><br><p>בסך הכול יש לבדוק <strong>{{CT:15}}</strong> נקודות חשודות שונות. לאחר השוואת הערכים מתקבל</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle P_{\\min}={{CT:16}},\\qquad P_{\\max}={{CT:17}}\\)<br>\\(\\displaystyle \\min f={{CT:18}},\\qquad \\max f={{CT:19}}\\)</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:pcount]] [[feedback:parc]] [[feedback:ppoints]] [[feedback:pvalues]] [[feedback:porder]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans6", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans7", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans8", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "candidatecount", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "parc", "value": 0.2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "c1:if is(equal(radcan(ans1-tans1),0)) then 1 else 0;c2:if is(equal(radcan(ans2-tans2),0)) then 1 else 0;cs:(c1+c2)/2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "1", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": "cs", "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "parc-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ —</b> קואורדינטות נכונות בנקודת הקשת: <strong>{@c1+c2@}</strong> מתוך 2.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "parc-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "pcount", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "candidatecount", "tans": "countnum", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pcount-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b> מספר הנקודות החשודות נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pcount-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> בדקו שוב את שני חלקי השפה ואת נקודות החיבור ביניהם.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "porder", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "bad:if is(ans7>ans8)=true then 1 else 0;ord:1-bad;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ord", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "porder-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "porder-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ה׳ —</b> <div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;font-weight:bold\">ערך המינימום שהזנתם גדול מערך המקסימום! זה לא הגיוני!</div></div>"}}]}, {"name": "ppoints", "value": 0.3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "p1:if is(equal(radcan(ans3-tans3),0)) then 1 else 0;p2:if is(equal(radcan(ans4-tans4),0)) then 1 else 0;p3:if is(equal(radcan(ans5-tans5),0)) then 1 else 0;p4:if is(equal(radcan(ans6-tans6),0)) then 1 else 0;ps:(p1+p2+p3+p4)/4;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "1", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": "ps", "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ppoints-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳–ד׳ —</b> קואורדינטות נכונות בנקודות הקיצון: <strong>{@p1+p2+p3+p4@}</strong> מתוך 4.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ppoints-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "pvalues", "value": 0.3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "v1:if is(equal(radcan(ans7-tans7),0)) then 1 else 0;v2:if is(equal(radcan(ans8-tans8),0)) then 1 else 0;vs:(v1+v2)/2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "1", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": "vs", "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pvalues-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ה׳ —</b> ערכי קיצון נכונים: <strong>{@v1+v2@}</strong> מתוך 2.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pvalues-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["Dminus", "Dplus", "Eminus", "Eplus", "M", "Parc", "Pmax", "Pmin", "R", "a", "arcder", "arcfun", "b", "c00", "c01", "c02", "c03", "c10", "c11", "c12", "c20", "c21", "c30", "circle", "circleDisplay", "countnum", "cx", "cy", "d", "deltaD", "deltaE", "edgeder", "edgefun", "func", "funcDisplay", "hasD", "maxVal", "minVal", "orient", "pairid", "q", "s", "s0", "smax", "smin", "t", "tans1", "tans2", "tans3", "tans4", "tans5", "tans6", "tans7", "tans8", "useD", "xDisplay", "yDisplay"], "nvariants": 50}